Package: writing-environment-repository
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Writing Environment contributors
Homepage: https://github.com/moonknight82/writing-environment
Priority: optional
Section: admin
Depends: ca-certificates
Description: Signed APT repository configuration for Writing Environment
 Installs the repository signing key, deb822 APT source, and package-scoped
 pinning for Writing Environment packages. Raspberry Pi OS sources remain
 installed and continue to provide the base operating system.
